usage: slopmop NOUN VERB [selectors] [--params] [output flags] [positional]

nouns:
  node, nodes             cluster nodes
  user, users             access users
  group, groups           access groups
  logs, log               node logs
  service, services, svc  node services
  network, networks, net  node network interfaces
  file, files             files on the nodes

more help: slopmop NOUN -h, slopmop NOUN VERB -h
